<view class="screen"><view class="eyebrow">WHALEU · 私信请求恢复</view><view class="title">确认原请求</view><view class="status">{{status}}</view><view wx:if="{{error}}" class="error">{{error}}</view><navigator wx:if="{{!hasSession}}" class="link" url="/pages/login/login">登录后查看</navigator>
  <view wx:if="{{pending}}" class="card"><view class="meta">操作：{{operation}} · 原请求编号：{{requestId}}</view><view wx:if="{{pendingText}}"><view class="section-title">尚未确认的原文</view><text class="body" selectable="true">{{pendingText}}</text></view><view class="notice">原文不会被新草稿覆盖。查询只返回操作回执；成功后需通过当前会话权限重新读取消息。来源删除或身份变化不会替换原请求。</view><button bindtap="onReceipt" disabled="{{busy}}">先查询原回执</button><button wx:if="{{canRetry}}" bindtap="onRetry" disabled="{{busy}}">查询后按相同编号和原内容重试</button><button bindtap="onRequestCancel" disabled="{{busy}}">安全取消原请求</button></view>
  <view wx:if="{{canReedit || editing}}" class="card"><view class="section-title">未发送的原文</view><view class="notice">原请求已终结。原文只保留在当前页面内存中，离开页面、退出登录或切换账号会清除。</view><button wx:if="{{canReedit}}" bindtap="onReedit" disabled="{{busy || pending}}">重新编辑为新草稿</button><view wx:if="{{editing}}"><textarea value="{{draftText}}" maxlength="-1" bindinput="onDraftText" disabled="{{busy || pending}}" /><view class="notice">发送新草稿会重新核验会话并创建新的审核请求，不会重试原请求。</view><button bindtap="onSendDraft" disabled="{{busy || pending || !draftText}}">发送新草稿</button></view><button bindtap="onDiscardDraft" disabled="{{busy}}">清除原文与新草稿</button></view>
  <view wx:if="{{confirmCancel}}" class="confirm" aria-role="dialog"><view class="notice">确认安全取消原请求？服务端会阻止尚未执行的迟到请求；如果原请求已经完成，会返回真实结果，不能把已发送消息当作取消。</view><button bindtap="onConfirmCancel" disabled="{{busy}}">确认安全取消</button><button bindtap="onDismissCancel">保留原请求</button></view><view wx:if="{{outcome}}" class="notice">{{outcome}}</view><button wx:if="{{busy}}" bindtap="onCancel">停止等待（不撤销请求）</button><navigator wx:if="{{conversationId}}" class="link" url="/pages/private-message-detail/private-message-detail?conversationId={{conversationId}}">重新读取原会话 →</navigator><navigator class="link" url="/pages/private-message-list/private-message-list">私信列表 →</navigator><view class="notice">待确认原文仅存于当前账号的有限本地恢复记录；退出登录或切换账号会清除原文，但保留本账号的最小请求凭据；需回到原账号查询或安全取消。</view></view>
